/issues/12414\r\n\r\nThis PR clarifies the joypad button and axis documentation.\r\n- Personally, I'm not sure that game developers need to know that these button constants come from SDL. If I didn't know what SDL is, I would probably have been confused by it (\"What is SDL? Why do I need to know that these constants correspond to SDL constants?\")\r\n- Clarified several button names\r\n- Documented new Steam Controller buttons\r\n- Documented the meaning of the paddle buttons according to SDL documentation:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/f7fcb79c4399070be07caadfbe2304a9c94711fa/thirdparty/sdl/include/SDL3/SDL_gamepad.h#L166-L169\r\n\r\nTODO:\r\n- [x] Clarify the usage of the new Steam Controller buttons ( https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120373#issuecomment-4734737598 )\r\n \r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n- Requires https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120373 to be merged first (for Steam Controller support)","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","description":"","color":"ffddff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","descr